        <item>
            <title>1.0.9</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 07:26:06 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>15</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.9</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[AZ Hockey 1.0.9

A conflicting Goal or Chance no longer blocks unrelated event saves.

Matching stale saves resolve automatically.

Different tags require an explicit “Keep my tags” choice.

That choice preserves the current draft, players, and rink marker.

Open the disk image and drag AZ Hockey into your Applications folder, then sign in with your coach account. Installed coaches can also use Check for Updates.
]]></description>
