            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[AZ Hockey 1.0.8

Schedule saves remain responsive while uploads continue.

Valid dotted and single-digit-hour times are accepted.

Invalid times receive a correction message.

Pending entries, drafts, and newer local edits are preserved during recovery.

Open the disk image and drag AZ Hockey into your Applications folder, then sign in with your coach account. Installed coaches can also use Check for Updates.
]]></description>
